<!-- 🐛 根因修复（2026-09-10，KPI 卡片被胶囊/状态栏遮挡）：本页是 admin 分包
     里唯一同时开启 navigationStyle:custom + enablePullDownRefresh 的页面（见
     platform-admin.json），此前完全依赖 <navigation-bar> 自身在文档流里占据的
     隐式高度（style="height:{{totalHeight}}px"）把内容顶下去——一旦这个隐式
     高度在某次渲染时机上落空（下拉刷新原生层与自定义导航栏叠加的已知边界
     情况），后面紧跟的 pa-loading-state/pa-content 就会直接贴到屏幕物理顶部，
     KPI 卡片被状态栏/胶囊盖住一半。改为显式方案：<navigation-bar> 通过
     extClass 固定为 position:fixed（不再占用文档流高度，视觉上始终贴顶，
     不会被下拉刷新原生层影响），pa-page 本身用 onNavLayout 拿到的真实测量值
     contentTop 显式 padding-top 撑开——内容起始位置从"依赖隐式流式布局"变成
     "用同一份真实测量数据显式计算"，两者不会同时生效造成双重叠加。
     🐛 2026-09-06 的历史修复记录（margin-top/padding-top 不再叠加
     navigation-bar 已占用的 totalHeight）已随此次改造失效——当时的前提是
     "navigation-bar 占文档流"，现在这个前提已经不成立，特此说明避免后来者
     误以为这里"没修好、又叠加了一次" -->
<view class="pa-page" style="padding-top: {{contentTop}}px;">

  <!-- 🎨（2026-09-10 二次视觉减压）改用白底深色字——上一轮把这里改成与
       分包其余页面一致的品牌深红 #8C1D18，用户反馈"色块过厚"的观感并没有
       改善，反而饱和色比之前的深靛蓝更抢眼。这里改用与下方 .pa-content
       同一色系的近白色（不用纯 #FFFFFF，避免与卡片完全同色导致"看不出
       这是导航栏"），配合下方 .pa-nav-bar-fixed 的极淡描边/阴影维持一条
       可感知的分界线，而不是靠色块面积去区分导航栏与页面内容。
       高度/内边距：<navigation-bar> 组件本身按胶囊实测坐标算 barStyle，
       .weui-navigation-bar__inner 是 height:100% 且无 padding，背景天然
       严格贴合 (statusBarHeight + navBarHeight) 这一整块、不多不少，这里
       不需要（也不应该）额外叠加高度/padding。
       返回箭头与标题的垂直居中：同样由组件内部 _layout() 直接读取
       wx.getMenuButtonBoundingClientRect() 的 top/height 赋给内容区
       .weui-navigation-bar__content，与胶囊天然对齐，不依赖本页任何样式 -->
  <navigation-bar
    extClass="pa-nav-bar-fixed"
    title="平台管理"
    background="#FBFBFC"
    color="#1C2530"
    dark="{{false}}"
    back="{{true}}"
    showHomeButton="auto"
    bind:layout="onNavLayout"
  ></navigation-bar>

  <!-- 呼吸边距：与导航栏净空（已由 pa-page 的 padding-top 保证）是两回事，
       这里只负责视觉留白，不参与"避免遮挡"的计算 -->
  <view class="pa-loading-state" wx:if="{{!checkedAccess}}" style="margin-top: 24rpx;">
    <text>校验身份中...</text>
  </view>

  <!-- 🐛 根因修复：身份校验本身失败（网络异常/云函数未部署）时的独立错误态，
       与"确认有身份、但不是平台管理员"的拒绝态区分开——前者可以重试，后者不该
       给一个"重试"按钮误导用户以为多点几次就能有权限 -->
  <view class="pa-denied-state" wx:if="{{checkedAccess && accessError}}" style="margin-top: 24rpx;">
    <text class="pa-denied-icon">⚠️</text>
    <text class="pa-denied-title">身份校验失败</text>
    <text class="pa-denied-sub">{{accessError}}</text>
    <button class="pa-denied-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onRetryCheckAccess">重新校验</button>
  </view>

  <view class="pa-denied-state" wx:if="{{checkedAccess && !accessError && !isPlatformAdmin}}" style="margin-top: 24rpx;">
    <text class="pa-denied-icon">🚫</text>
    <text class="pa-denied-title">无权限访问</text>
    <text class="pa-denied-sub">本页面仅限 SaaS 平台管理员（开发者）使用，且不会显示任何门店财务明细。</text>
    <button class="pa-denied-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onGoBack">返回首页</button>
  </view>

  <view class="pa-content" wx:if="{{checkedAccess && !accessError && isPlatformAdmin}}" style="padding-top: 16rpx;">

    <!-- 📊 统计总览看板：三张轻量磨砂白卡片，横跨两个 Tab 共用，随时能看到
         "有多少码等着卖出去 / 有多少机构在真实付费 / 有几家快到期该跟进续费"。
         🎨（2026-09-10）外层 .pa-kpi-panel 铺一层极淡暖色渐变，卡片自身用
         半透明白 + backdrop-filter 模糊——磨砂质感需要底下有色彩变化才能
         被看出来，纯色背景上加 backdrop-filter 视觉上和纯白卡片没有区别 -->
    <view class="pa-kpi-panel">
      <view class="pa-kpi-row">
        <view class="pa-kpi-card">
          <text class="pa-kpi-num" wx:if="{{!overviewLoading}}">{{overview.totals.unusedActivationCodeCount || 0}}</text>
          <view class="pa-kpi-skel" wx:else></view>
          <text class="pa-kpi-label">待核销码</text>
        </view>
        <view class="pa-kpi-card">
          <text class="pa-kpi-num" wx:if="{{!overviewLoading}}">{{overview.totals.activeSubscriptionCount || 0}}</text>
          <view class="pa-kpi-skel" wx:else></view>
          <text class="pa-kpi-label">已激活机构</text>
        </view>
        <view class="pa-kpi-card">
          <text class="pa-kpi-num {{overview.soonExpiringTenants.length > 0 ? 'pa-kpi-num-warn' : ''}}" wx:if="{{!overviewLoading}}">{{overview.soonExpiringTenants.length || 0}}</text>
          <view class="pa-kpi-skel" wx:else></view>
          <text class="pa-kpi-label">7天内到期</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 🗂️ 顶层 Tab 分流：吸顶切换栏，滚动时始终停在导航栏正下方 -->
    <view class="pa-tab-switcher" style="top: {{contentTop}}px;">
      <view class="pa-tab-item {{activeTab === 'codes' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="codes" bindtap="onSwitchTab">🔑 授权码管理</view>
      <view class="pa-tab-item {{activeTab === 'tenants' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="tenants" bindtap="onSwitchTab">🏢 机构管理</view>
      <view class="pa-tab-item {{activeTab === 'inspect' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="inspect" bindtap="onSwitchTab">🔍 平台巡检</view>
    </view>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════ 🔑 授权码管理 ═══════════════════════ -->
    <block wx:if="{{activeTab === 'codes'}}">

      <!-- 🆕（可视化制卡台账）顶部库存看板：专业版/旗舰版未核销余量 + 已核销
           总数，getStats 用 .count() 聚合查询，与下方分页列表是两次独立云调用 -->
      <view class="pa-stats-row">
        <view class="pa-stat-card">
          <text class="pa-stat-value">{{codeStats.unusedPro}}</text>
          <text class="pa-stat-label">专业版余量</text>
        </view>
        <view class="pa-stat-card">
          <text class="pa-stat-value">{{codeStats.unusedEnterprise}}</text>
          <text class="pa-stat-label">旗舰版余量</text>
        </view>
        <view class="pa-stat-card">
          <text class="pa-stat-value">{{codeStats.usedTotal}}</text>
          <text class="pa-stat-label">已核销总数</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="pa-section-header">
        <text class="pa-section-title">授权码台账</text>
        <button class="pa-btn-create" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onOpenGenerateCodesSheet">+ 生成授权码</button>
      </view>

      <!-- 刚生成的这一批：置顶展示 + 一键复制，不用去下面台账列表里翻找 -->
      <view class="pa-generated-box" wx:if="{{lastGeneratedCodes.length > 0}}">
        <view class="pa-generated-header">
          <text class="pa-generated-title">✅ 刚生成 {{lastGeneratedCodes.length}} 张授权码</text>
          <view class="pa-generated-copy-all" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCopyAllGeneratedCodes">复制全部</view>
        </view>
        <view class="pa-generated-row" wx:for="{{lastGeneratedCodes}}" wx:key="code" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCopyActivationCode" data-item="{{item}}">
          <text class="pa-generated-code">{{item.code}}</text>
          <text class="pa-generated-meta" wx:if="{{item.codeType === 'add_on'}}">扩容门店包 · +{{item.extraStores}}家</text>
          <text class="pa-generated-meta" wx:else>{{planLabels[item.planType] || item.planType}} · {{item.durationDays}}天</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="pa-codes-filter-row">
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{activationCodesFilter === 'UNUSED' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="UNUSED" bindtap="onSwitchActivationCodesFilter">未使用</view>
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{activationCodesFilter === 'USED' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="USED" bindtap="onSwitchActivationCodesFilter">已核销</view>
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{activationCodesFilter === 'REVOKED' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="REVOKED" bindtap="onSwitchActivationCodesFilter">已作废</view>
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{activationCodesFilter === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="all" bindtap="onSwitchActivationCodesFilter">全部</view>
      </view>

      <!-- 🆕（可视化制卡台账）套餐类型筛选：与上面的状态筛选是两个独立维度，
           可以同时生效 -->
      <view class="pa-codes-filter-row">
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{activationCodesPlanFilter === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="all" bindtap="onSwitchActivationCodesPlanFilter">全部套餐</view>
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{activationCodesPlanFilter === 'pro' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="pro" bindtap="onSwitchActivationCodesPlanFilter">专业版</view>
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{activationCodesPlanFilter === 'enterprise' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="enterprise" bindtap="onSwitchActivationCodesPlanFilter">旗舰版</view>
      </view>

      <!-- 首屏骨架屏：区分"正在加载"与"确认加载完、真的没有数据"两种状态，
           不会在请求还没回来前就先亮出"暂无数据"误导用户 -->
      <view class="pa-code-card pa-skel-card" wx:if="{{activationCodesLoading && activationCodes.length === 0}}">
        <view class="pa-skel-bar pa-skel-bar-lg"></view>
        <view class="pa-skel-bar pa-skel-bar-sm"></view>
      </view>

      <view class="pa-empty-state" wx:elif="{{!activationCodesLoading && activationCodes.length === 0}}">
        <text class="pa-empty-icon">📭</text>
        <text class="pa-empty-title">暂无{{activationCodesFilter === 'all' ? '' : (codeStatusLabels[activationCodesFilter] || '')}}授权码</text>
        <text class="pa-empty-sub">点击上方"+ 生成授权码"铸造第一批</text>
      </view>

      <block wx:else>
        <view class="pa-code-card" wx:for="{{activationCodes}}" wx:key="code" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCopyActivationCode" data-item="{{item}}">
          <view class="pa-code-row-top">
            <view class="pa-code-row-top-left">
              <text class="pa-code-text">{{item.code}}</text>
              <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10）显式复制按钮：catchtap 阻止冒泡到卡片本身的
                   复制 bindtap，避免触发两次 Toast；复制内容与点整张卡片一致
                   （格式化文本，非裸码），只是给一个更明确可见的点击入口 -->
              <view class="pa-code-copy-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" catchtap="onCopyActivationCode" data-item="{{item}}">📋 复制</view>
            </view>
            <text class="pa-code-status pa-code-status-{{item.status}}">{{codeStatusLabels[item.status] || item.status}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="pa-code-row-bottom">
            <block wx:if="{{item.codeType === 'add_on'}}">
              <text class="pa-plan-badge pa-plan-badge-addon">扩容门店包</text>
              <text class="pa-duration-badge">+{{item.extraStores}}家</text>
            </block>
            <block wx:else>
              <text class="pa-plan-badge pa-plan-badge-{{item.planType}}">{{planLabels[item.planType] || item.planType}}</text>
              <text class="pa-duration-badge">{{item.durationDays}}天</text>
            </block>
            <!-- 🎯（2026-09-10 双轨兼容）未核销时标注这张码是"定向空间专用"
                 （铸造时绑定了 targetStoreId）还是"通用兑换码"（任意机构/
                 空间都能核销）——核销后看 usedStoreId 更准确，这个标注只在
                 UNUSED 时展示 -->
            <text class="pa-target-badge pa-target-badge-dedicated" wx:if="{{item.status === 'UNUSED' && item.targetStoreName}}">🎯 定向空间专用：{{item.targetStoreName}}</text>
            <text class="pa-target-badge pa-target-badge-generic" wx:if="{{item.status === 'UNUSED' && !item.targetStoreName}}">🌐 通用兑换码</text>
            <!-- 🗑️ 仅未使用的码可作废：catchtap 阻止冒泡到卡片本身的复制 bindtap，
                 避免点"作废"顺带又触发一次复制 Toast -->
            <view class="pa-code-revoke-btn" wx:if="{{item.status === 'UNUSED'}}" hover-class="btn-hover" catchtap="onRevokeActivationCode" data-codeid="{{item._id}}" data-code="{{item.code}}" data-status="{{item.status}}">作废</view>
          </view>
          <!-- 已核销：明确展示所属机构/容器 + 生效空间/门店 + 核销时间，不是
               只有一个状态 Tag。🆕（2026-09-10 双轨兼容：空间核销落地追踪）
               三行都固定展示，字段缺失时兜底，不再让某一行在缺失时整行消失、
               与其余行的展示逻辑不一致：
               - 所属机构：tenantName（活联反查，机构改名/注销后自动跟着变）
                 兜底原始 tenantId，再兜底 "-"
               - 生效空间：usedStoreName（核销时快照）兜底"未指定具体空间"
                 ——这不是数据丢失，代表当时走的是机构级（连锁/HQ）核销，
                 没有归属到某一具体空间 -->
          <view class="pa-code-redeemed-box" wx:if="{{item.status === 'USED'}}">
            <text class="pa-code-redeemed-row">🏢 {{item.tenantName || item.tenantId || '-'}}</text>
            <text class="pa-code-redeemed-row">📍 {{item.usedStoreName || '未指定具体空间'}}</text>
            <text class="pa-code-redeemed-row">🕐 {{item.usedAtLabel || item.redeemedAtLabel || '-'}}</text>
          </view>
          <!-- 已作废：展示作废时间 + 原因，与已核销的信息盒子同一视觉语言 -->
          <view class="pa-code-redeemed-box pa-code-revoked-box" wx:if="{{item.status === 'REVOKED'}}">
            <text class="pa-code-redeemed-row" wx:if="{{item.revokedAtLabel}}">🕐 {{item.revokedAtLabel}}</text>
            <text class="pa-code-redeemed-row" wx:if="{{item.revokeReason}}">📝 {{item.revokeReason}}</text>
          </view>
          <!-- 🆕（可视化制卡台账）铸造备注：非必填，有填才展示 -->
          <text class="pa-code-note" wx:if="{{item.note}}">📝 {{item.note}}</text>
        </view>

        <view class="pa-load-more-row" wx:if="{{activationCodesLoadingMore}}">
          <text>加载中...</text>
        </view>
        <view class="pa-load-more-row" wx:elif="{{!activationCodesHasMore}}">
          <text>没有更多了</text>
        </view>
      </block>

    </block>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════ 🏢 机构管理 ═══════════════════════ -->
    <block wx:elif="{{activeTab === 'tenants'}}">

      <view class="pa-soon-expire-box" wx:if="{{overview.soonExpiringTenants.length > 0}}">
        <text class="pa-soon-title">⚠️ 7 天内到期机构</text>
        <view class="pa-soon-item" wx:for="{{overview.soonExpiringTenants}}" wx:key="_id">
          <text>{{item.tenantId}} · {{planLabels[item.planType] || item.planType}} · 到期 {{item.serviceExpireDate}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="pa-section-header">
        <text class="pa-section-title">机构列表</text>
        <button class="pa-btn-create" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onOpenCreateTenantSheet">+ 新建机构</button>
      </view>

      <!-- 🆕 机构搜索：走服务端 keyword 过滤（listTenants 有分页，本地过滤会
           漏掉还没翻到的机构），回车/键盘"搜索"键触发，不做输入即触发的
           防抖搜索 -->
      <input
        class="pa-input pa-tenant-search-input"
        placeholder="按机构名称/ID搜索"
        confirm-type="search"
        value="{{tenantSearchKeyword}}"
        bindinput="onTenantSearchInput"
        bindconfirm="onTenantSearchConfirm"
      />

      <!-- 🆕 状态筛选：纯本地快筛，基于 decorateTenants() 算出的 displayStatus -->
      <view class="pa-tenant-filter-row">
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{tenantStatusFilter === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="all" bindtap="onSwitchTenantStatusFilter">全部</view>
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{tenantStatusFilter === 'active' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="active" bindtap="onSwitchTenantStatusFilter">生效中</view>
        <view class="pa-codes-filter-tab {{tenantStatusFilter === 'inactive' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="inactive" bindtap="onSwitchTenantStatusFilter">已到期/未开通</view>
      </view>

      <view class="pa-tenant-card pa-skel-card" wx:if="{{tenantsLoading && tenants.length === 0}}">
        <view class="pa-skel-bar pa-skel-bar-lg"></view>
        <view class="pa-skel-bar pa-skel-bar-sm"></view>
      </view>

      <!-- 🆕 空状态区分"真的一家都没有"与"搜索没搜到"，后者不该提示"新建机构" -->
      <view class="pa-empty-state" wx:elif="{{!tenantsLoading && tenants.length === 0 && !tenantSearchKeyword}}">
        <text class="pa-empty-icon">🏢</text>
        <text class="pa-empty-title">暂无机构</text>
        <text class="pa-empty-sub">点击上方"+ 新建机构"创建第一个</text>
      </view>
      <view class="pa-empty-state" wx:elif="{{!tenantsLoading && tenants.length === 0 && tenantSearchKeyword}}">
        <text class="pa-empty-icon">🔍</text>
        <text class="pa-empty-title">未找到匹配的机构</text>
        <text class="pa-empty-sub">换个关键词试试</text>
      </view>

      <block wx:else>
        <view
          class="pa-tenant-card"
          wx:for="{{tenants}}"
          wx:key="_id"
          wx:if="{{tenantStatusFilter === 'all' || (tenantStatusFilter === 'active' ? item.displayStatus === 'active' : item.displayStatus !== 'active')}}"
        >
          <view class="pa-tenant-header">
            <!-- 🐛 根因修复（2026-09-10）：机构名称为空时此前直接渲染空白，容易被
                 误认成渲染失败；兜底展示"未命名机构"，纯展示层改动，不影响真实数据 -->
            <text class="pa-tenant-name">{{item.name || '未命名机构'}}</text>
            <text class="pa-tenant-status pa-status-{{item.displayStatus}}">{{item.displayStatusLabel}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="pa-tenant-body">
            <view class="pa-tenant-plan-row" wx:if="{{item.subscription}}">
              <text class="pa-plan-badge pa-plan-badge-{{item.subscription.planType}}">{{planLabels[item.subscription.planType] || item.subscription.planType}}</text>
              <text class="pa-plan-badge pa-plan-badge-expiring" wx:if="{{item.isExpiringSoon}}">⚠️ 即将到期</text>
              <text class="pa-tenant-row pa-expire-text">到期：{{item.subscription.serviceExpireDate}}</text>
            </view>
            <text class="pa-tenant-row" wx:else>尚未开通订阅</text>
            <!-- 🆕 机构 ID 加深对比度 + 一键复制 -->
            <view class="pa-tenant-id-row">
              <text class="pa-tenant-id">机构 ID：{{item._id}}</text>
              <text class="pa-tenant-id-copy" catchtap="onCopyTenantId" data-id="{{item._id}}">复制</text>
            </view>
            <!-- 🏪 门店容量进度：门店本身不会在这张机构列表里单独占一行（门店是挂在
                 tenantId 下的子资源），这里直接把"已用/配额"亮出来，避免管理员误以为
                 某个门店"丢了"——点"查看门店"即可展开该机构下的具体门店清单。
                 配额满时进度条变红，与"配额已满"的建店拦截提示相呼应 -->
            <view class="pa-store-quota-row">
              <text class="pa-tenant-row pa-tenant-store-count">🏪 {{item.storeCount || 0}} / {{item.storeLimit}} 家门店</text>
              <view class="pa-store-quota-bar">
                <view class="pa-store-quota-bar-fill {{item.isStoreQuotaFull ? 'pa-store-quota-bar-full' : ''}}" style="width: {{item.storeQuotaPercent}}%;"></view>
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>
          <!-- 🆕（操作栏紧凑化）2 个描边胶囊主操作 + 1 个"更多"入口——暂停/恢复
               服务、终止订阅收进 onOpenTenantMoreActions 的原生 ActionSheet。
               🐛 根因修复（2026-09-10）：此前"更多"入口挂了 wx:if="{{item.subscription}}"，
               导致从未开通订阅的空/测试机构（图二那类"尚未开通订阅"脏数据）
               反而没有暂停服务入口，清理不掉。updateTenantStatus 本身只依赖
               tenants 文档、与是否有订阅无关，onOpenTenantMoreActions 内部
               也已经按 isActivePaidPlan 单独判断是否展示"终止订阅"——这里
               去掉该条件，让所有机构（含无订阅机构）都能走"暂停服务"这条
               已有、留痕、可逆的路径 -->
          <view class="pa-tenant-actions">
            <!-- 🐛 根因修复（2026-09-10 控制台警告）：item.name 为空的"未命名机构"
                 此前把 undefined 原样透传进 data-tenantname，setData 收到
                 undefined 字段会报 "Setting data field 'xxx' to undefined is
                 invalid"——与卡片标题展示同一套兜底 -->
            <view class="pa-tenant-action-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" data-tenantid="{{item._id}}" data-tenantname="{{item.name || '未命名机构'}}" bindtap="onOpenTenantStores">查看门店</view>
            <view class="pa-tenant-action-btn pa-tenant-action-btn-primary" hover-class="btn-hover" data-tenantid="{{item._id}}" data-tenantname="{{item.name || '未命名机构'}}" bindtap="onOpenRenewForm">{{item.subscription ? '续费' : '开通订阅'}}</view>
            <view class="pa-tenant-more-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" data-item="{{item}}" bindtap="onOpenTenantMoreActions">⋯</view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="pa-load-more-row" wx:if="{{tenantsLoadingMore}}">
          <text>加载中...</text>
        </view>
        <view class="pa-load-more-row" wx:elif="{{!tenantsHasMore}}">
          <text>没有更多了</text>
        </view>
      </block>

    </block>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════ 🔍 平台巡检（2026-09-09 平台巡检自助授权，2026-09-10 体验与交互全面升级） ═══════════════════════ -->
    <block wx:elif="{{activeTab === 'inspect'}}">
      <view class="pa-inspect-card">
        <text class="pa-inspect-title">🔍 平台巡检 · 自助授权</text>

        <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10）折叠式安全须知——默认只占一行，点击展开完整说明，
             把原来长段文字腾出的空间让给下方三级选择器 -->
        <view class="pa-inspect-notice {{inspectNoticeExpanded ? 'expanded' : ''}}" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onToggleInspectNotice">
          <text class="pa-inspect-notice-brief" wx:if="{{!inspectNoticeExpanded}}">💡 巡检安全须知（点击展开）</text>
          <block wx:else>
            <text class="pa-inspect-notice-full">
              平台管理员默认不接触任何机构的业务数据。需要临时排障某一家具体门店时，先选机构、再选
              门店即可完成授权并进入档案编辑，不用再去云开发控制台翻门店 _id——授权范围严格限定到
              这一家店，2 小时后自动失效，也不会授予整个机构或 super_admin/platform_admin 角色本身。
              每次授权/撤销都会留痕，见下方"当前生效中的巡检"。
            </text>
            <text class="pa-inspect-notice-collapse">点击收起 ▲</text>
          </block>
        </view>

        <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10）选择路径——机构 > 门店，替代原来第二级顶部的
             "❮ 重新选择机构" 纯文字返回按钮，同时承担面包屑展示作用 -->
        <view class="pa-inspect-path">
          <text
            class="pa-inspect-path-item {{inspectStage === 'tenant' ? 'active' : 'done'}}"
            hover-class="{{inspectStage === 'store' ? 'btn-hover' : ''}}"
            bindtap="{{inspectStage === 'store' ? 'onInspectBackToTenant' : ''}}"
          >{{inspectSelectedTenantName || '① 选机构'}}</text>
          <text class="pa-inspect-path-sep" wx:if="{{inspectStage === 'store'}}">›</text>
          <text class="pa-inspect-path-item {{inspectStage === 'store' ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:if="{{inspectStage === 'store'}}">{{inspectSelectedStoreName || '② 选门店'}}</text>
        </view>

        <!-- 第一级：搜索并选择机构 -->
        <block wx:if="{{inspectStage === 'tenant'}}">
          <view class="pa-inspect-field">
            <input
              class="pa-inspect-input"
              value="{{inspectTenantKeyword}}"
              placeholder="搜索机构名称/ID，留空看最近创建"
              confirm-type="search"
              bindinput="onInspectTenantKeywordInput"
              bindconfirm="onInspectTenantSearchConfirm"
            />
          </view>

          <view class="pa-inspect-picker-loading" wx:if="{{inspectTenantsLoading}}"><text>加载中...</text></view>

          <view class="pa-empty-state" wx:elif="{{inspectTenantResults.length === 0}}">
            <text class="pa-empty-icon">🔍</text>
            <text class="pa-empty-title">未找到机构</text>
            <text class="pa-empty-sub">换个关键词试试，或留空搜索查看最近创建的机构</text>
          </view>

          <view class="pa-inspect-picker-list" wx:else>
            <view
              class="pa-inspect-picker-row"
              wx:for="{{inspectTenantResults}}"
              wx:key="_id"
              data-tenantid="{{item._id}}"
              data-tenantname="{{item.name || '未命名机构'}}"
              hover-class="btn-hover"
              bindtap="onInspectSelectTenant"
            >
              <view class="pa-inspect-picker-main">
                <text class="pa-inspect-picker-name">{{item.name || '未命名机构'}}</text>
                <text class="pa-inspect-picker-meta">🏪 {{item.storeCount || 0}} 家门店</text>
              </view>
              <text class="pa-inspect-picker-arrow">❯</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </block>

        <!-- 第二级：搜索/过滤并选择该机构下的门店 + 角色 -->
        <block wx:if="{{inspectStage === 'store'}}">
          <view class="pa-inspect-field">
            <input
              class="pa-inspect-input"
              value="{{inspectStoreKeyword}}"
              placeholder="搜索/过滤门店名称"
              bindinput="onInspectStoreKeywordInput"
            />
          </view>

          <view class="pa-inspect-picker-loading" wx:if="{{inspectStoresLoading}}"><text>门店加载中...</text></view>

          <view class="pa-empty-state" wx:elif="{{inspectStoresFiltered.length === 0}}">
            <text class="pa-empty-icon">🏪</text>
            <text class="pa-empty-title">{{inspectStoreKeyword ? '没有匹配的门店' : '该机构下暂无门店'}}</text>
          </view>

          <view class="pa-inspect-picker-list" wx:else>
            <view
              class="pa-inspect-picker-row {{inspectSelectedStoreId === item._id ? 'active' : ''}}"
              wx:for="{{inspectStoresFiltered}}"
              wx:key="_id"
              data-storeid="{{item._id}}"
              data-storename="{{item.storeName}}"
              hover-class="btn-hover"
              bindtap="onInspectSelectStore"
            >
              <view class="pa-inspect-picker-main">
                <text class="pa-inspect-picker-name">{{item.storeName}}</text>
                <text class="pa-inspect-picker-meta">{{item.status === 'inactive' ? '已停用' : '正常'}}</text>
              </view>
              <text class="pa-inspect-picker-check" wx:if="{{inspectSelectedStoreId === item._id}}">✓</text>
            </view>
          </view>

          <!-- 🐛 根因修复并回滚（2026-09-10）：上一版这里按"账号 tenantId 恰好
               等于选中机构"收起角色选择区、直接跳过授权——结果导致 canManage
               永远拿不到真实的 authorizedTenants 授权，跳转过去editing 区
               全部置灰。platform_admin 对任何机构都必须显式选一个临时授权
               角色，没有"已有常态身份可以跳过"这回事，见 onSubmitInspectGrant
               同一处修复注释 -->
          <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10）角色选择区改为紧凑 Radio Tag/Card，label 短标签 +
               desc 副文本清晰标注权限范围，替代原来单行长文案的按钮组 -->
          <view class="pa-inspect-field" wx:if="{{inspectSelectedStoreId}}">
            <text class="pa-inspect-label">授权角色</text>
            <view class="pa-inspect-role-tags">
              <view
                class="pa-inspect-role-tag {{inspectRole === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}"
                wx:for="{{inspectRoleOptions}}"
                wx:key="value"
                data-value="{{item.value}}"
                bindtap="onSelectInspectRole"
              >
                <text class="pa-inspect-role-tag-label">{{item.label}}</text>
                <text class="pa-inspect-role-tag-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>

          <text class="pa-inspect-error" wx:if="{{inspectError}}">{{inspectError}}</text>
        </block>
      </view>

      <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10 一键回收临时凭证，2026-09-10 卡片美化）当前生效中的
           巡检——突出剩余有效时间倒计时与门店名称，撤销/直接进入做成成对的
           轻量操作按钮 -->
      <view class="pa-inspect-card pa-inspect-grants-card">
        <view class="pa-section-header">
          <text class="pa-section-title">🕐 当前生效中的巡检</text>
        </view>

        <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10）撤销后不再留突兀空白：改用一行居中浅灰字提示，
             不用 pa-empty-state 那套带图标的大空状态（本区块本身就很轻量，
             大空状态视觉上过重） -->
        <view class="pa-inspect-grants-empty" wx:if="{{!activeGrantsLoading && activeGrants.length === 0}}">
          <text>当前无生效中的临时巡检凭证（沙盒隔离状态）</text>
        </view>

        <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10 排版重构）改为纵向三段式：标题行（门店名 + 小号短
             ID）→ 标签行（角色/机构/倒计时横排 Tag，flex-wrap 不挤压竖排）→
             操作行（右对齐成对按钮），替代此前"文字信息 + 按钮"左右两栏挤压
             导致文字被压窄成竖排的问题 -->
        <view class="pa-inspect-grant-row" wx:for="{{activeGrants}}" wx:key="tenantId">
          <text class="pa-inspect-grant-store">🏪 {{item.storeNameLabel}}</text>
          <text class="pa-inspect-grant-store-id">ID: {{item.storeIdShortLabel}}</text>

          <view class="pa-inspect-grant-tags">
            <text class="pa-inspect-grant-tag">{{item.roleLabel}}</text>
            <text class="pa-inspect-grant-tag">{{item.tenantNameLabel}}</text>
            <text class="pa-inspect-grant-tag {{item.remainingLabel === '已过期' ? 'expired' : 'countdown'}}">⏱ {{item.remainingLabel}}</text>
          </view>

          <view class="pa-inspect-grant-actions">
            <button
              class="pa-inspect-grant-btn pa-inspect-grant-btn-enter"
              hover-class="btn-hover"
              data-storeid="{{item.stores[0]}}"
              bindtap="onEnterActiveGrant"
            >直接进入</button>
            <button
              class="pa-inspect-grant-btn pa-inspect-grant-btn-revoke"
              hover-class="btn-hover"
              loading="{{revokingGrantTenantId === item.tenantId}}"
              disabled="{{!!revokingGrantTenantId}}"
              data-tenantid="{{item.tenantId}}"
              bindtap="onRevokeActiveGrant"
            >撤销</button>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10）吸底浮动主操作按钮——选中门店后才出现，副标题提示
           具体门店与角色权限，loading 态防重复点击 -->
      <view class="fa-safe-area-spacer" style="height: 140rpx;" wx:if="{{inspectStage === 'store' && inspectSelectedStoreId}}"></view>
    </block>

    <view class="fa-safe-area-spacer" wx:if="{{!(activeTab === 'inspect' && inspectStage === 'store' && inspectSelectedStoreId)}}"></view>
  </view>

  <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10）巡检吸底主按钮——独立于滚动容器之外，position:fixed 悬浮于底部 -->
  <view class="pa-inspect-sticky-bar" wx:if="{{activeTab === 'inspect' && inspectStage === 'store' && inspectSelectedStoreId}}">
    <button
      class="pa-inspect-sticky-btn"
      hover-class="btn-hover"
      bindtap="onSubmitInspectGrant"
      loading="{{inspectSubmitting}}"
      disabled="{{inspectSubmitting}}"
    >
      <text class="pa-inspect-sticky-btn-main">一键授权并进入档案</text>
      <text class="pa-inspect-sticky-btn-sub">{{inspectSelectedStoreName}} · {{inspectRoleLabel}}权限</text>
    </button>
  </view>

  <!-- 🌸 底部抽屉：生成授权码 -->
  <view class="pa-sheet-mask" wx:if="{{showGenerateCodesSheet}}" bindtap="onCloseGenerateCodesSheet">
    <view class="pa-sheet-box" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="pa-sheet-handle"></view>
      <text class="pa-sheet-title">生成授权码</text>

      <text class="pa-field-label">授权码类型</text>
      <view class="pa-plan-row">
        <view class="pa-plan-tag {{generateCodesForm.codeType === 'package' ? 'active' : ''}}" hover-class="btn-hover" data-type="package" bindtap="onSelectCodeType">套餐码</view>
        <view class="pa-plan-tag {{generateCodesForm.codeType === 'add_on' ? 'active' : ''}}" hover-class="btn-hover" data-type="add_on" bindtap="onSelectCodeType">扩容门店包（¥200/店/年）</view>
      </view>

      <block wx:if="{{generateCodesForm.codeType === 'add_on'}}">
        <text class="pa-field-label">单张码扩容门店数（最多 20 家）</text>
        <input class="pa-input {{generateCodesErrors.extraStores ? 'pa-input-error' : ''}}" type="number" placeholder="如：1" value="{{generateCodesForm.extraStores}}" bindinput="onGenerateCodesFormInput" data-field="extraStores" />
        <text class="pa-field-error" wx:if="{{generateCodesErrors.extraStores}}">{{generateCodesErrors.extraStores}}</text>
      </block>
      <block wx:else>
        <text class="pa-field-label">套餐档位</text>
        <view class="pa-plan-row">
          <view class="pa-plan-tag {{generateCodesForm.planType === 'pro' ? 'active' : ''}}" hover-class="btn-hover" data-plan="pro" bindtap="onSelectCodePlan">专业版（¥1688/年）</view>
          <view class="pa-plan-tag {{generateCodesForm.planType === 'enterprise' ? 'active' : ''}}" hover-class="btn-hover" data-plan="enterprise" bindtap="onSelectCodePlan">旗舰版（¥3688/年）</view>
        </view>

        <text class="pa-field-label">有效期（天）</text>
        <input class="pa-input {{generateCodesErrors.durationDays ? 'pa-input-error' : ''}}" type="number" placeholder="如：365" value="{{generateCodesForm.durationDays}}" bindinput="onGenerateCodesFormInput" data-field="durationDays" />
        <text class="pa-field-error" wx:if="{{generateCodesErrors.durationDays}}">{{generateCodesErrors.durationDays}}</text>
      </block>

      <text class="pa-field-label">生成数量（单次最多 50 张）</text>
      <input class="pa-input {{generateCodesErrors.quantity ? 'pa-input-error' : ''}}" type="number" placeholder="如：1" value="{{generateCodesForm.quantity}}" bindinput="onGenerateCodesFormInput" data-field="quantity" />
      <text class="pa-field-error" wx:if="{{generateCodesErrors.quantity}}">{{generateCodesErrors.quantity}}</text>

      <!-- 🆕（可视化制卡台账）备注：非必填，纯留痕，只对套餐码生效——扩容包
           码的用途本身已经很明确，不需要额外备注 -->
      <block wx:if="{{generateCodesForm.codeType === 'package'}}">
        <text class="pa-field-label">备注（选填，如"卖给XX机构"）</text>
        <input class="pa-input" placeholder="不填则留空" value="{{generateCodesForm.note}}" bindinput="onGenerateCodesFormInput" data-field="note" />
      </block>

      <!-- 🎯（2026-09-10 双轨兼容：定向空间专用码）选填，铸造这批码时直接
           焊死给一家具体门店/空间——雨花斋去中心化单店自治场景下把码定向发给
           某个大家长，而不是发一张任何机构都能兑的通用码。留空即原有的
           "通用兑换码"语义，完全不受影响；门店 ID 可在【机构管理】Tab 的
           "查看门店"抽屉里核对复制 -->
      <text class="pa-field-label">定向门店ID（选填，留空为通用兑换码）</text>
      <input class="pa-input" placeholder="留空则任意机构/空间均可核销" value="{{generateCodesForm.targetStoreId}}" bindinput="onGenerateCodesFormInput" data-field="targetStoreId" />

      <view class="pa-sheet-actions">
        <button class="pa-btn-cancel" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCloseGenerateCodesSheet" disabled="{{generatingCodes}}">取消</button>
        <button class="pa-btn-submit" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onSubmitGenerateCodes" loading="{{generatingCodes}}" disabled="{{generatingCodes}}">铸造授权码</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 🌸 底部抽屉：新建机构 -->
  <view class="pa-sheet-mask" wx:if="{{showCreateTenantSheet}}" bindtap="onCloseCreateTenantSheet">
    <view class="pa-sheet-box" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="pa-sheet-handle"></view>
      <text class="pa-sheet-title">新建机构</text>

      <text class="pa-field-label">机构名称</text>
      <input class="pa-input {{createFormErrors.name ? 'pa-input-error' : ''}}" placeholder="必填" value="{{createForm.name}}" bindinput="onCreateFormInput" data-field="name" />
      <text class="pa-field-error" wx:if="{{createFormErrors.name}}">{{createFormErrors.name}}</text>

      <text class="pa-field-label">联系人姓名</text>
      <input class="pa-input" placeholder="选填" value="{{createForm.contactName}}" bindinput="onCreateFormInput" data-field="contactName" />

      <text class="pa-field-label">联系电话</text>
      <input class="pa-input" placeholder="选填" value="{{createForm.contactPhone}}" bindinput="onCreateFormInput" data-field="contactPhone" />

      <view class="pa-sheet-actions">
        <button class="pa-btn-cancel" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCloseCreateTenantSheet" disabled="{{creatingTenant}}">取消</button>
        <button class="pa-btn-submit" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onSubmitCreateTenant" loading="{{creatingTenant}}" disabled="{{creatingTenant}}">创建机构</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 🏪 底部抽屉：机构下挂门店清单——排查"机构列表看不到某个门店"的入口，
       门店本身不在机构列表里单独占一行，这里按 tenantId 展开具体门店 -->
  <view class="pa-sheet-mask" wx:if="{{showTenantStoresSheet}}" bindtap="onCloseTenantStores">
    <view class="pa-sheet-box" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="pa-sheet-handle"></view>
      <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10）顶部标准 × 关闭——去掉底部整条 .pa-sheet-actions
           操作栏，把这部分高度还给滚动区，门店多时不用为了看到"关闭"按钮
           而多划一屏 -->
      <view class="pa-sheet-header-row">
        <text class="pa-sheet-title pa-sheet-title-inline">【{{tenantStoresTenantName}}】门店清单</text>
        <view class="pa-sheet-close-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCloseTenantStores">✕</view>
      </view>

      <view class="pa-code-card pa-skel-card" wx:if="{{tenantStoresLoading}}">
        <view class="pa-skel-bar pa-skel-bar-lg"></view>
        <view class="pa-skel-bar pa-skel-bar-sm"></view>
      </view>

      <view class="pa-empty-state" wx:elif="{{tenantStores.length === 0}}">
        <text class="pa-empty-icon">🏪</text>
        <text class="pa-empty-title">该机构下暂无门店</text>
      </view>

      <scroll-view scroll-y class="pa-tenant-store-list" wx:else>
        <view class="pa-tenant-store-row" wx:for="{{tenantStores}}" wx:key="_id">
          <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10 状态标签内联）改为紧贴门店名右侧的行内小胶囊
               （用 gap 代替 space-between），不再被推到卡片最右边缘 -->
          <view class="pa-tenant-store-row-top">
            <text class="pa-tenant-store-name">{{item.storeName}}</text>
            <text class="pa-tenant-status pa-status-{{item.status === 'inactive' ? 'expired' : 'active'}}">{{item.status === 'inactive' ? '已停用' : '正常'}}</text>
          </view>
          <text class="pa-tenant-row" wx:if="{{item.city || item.province}}">📍 {{item.province}}{{item.city}}</text>
          <text class="pa-tenant-row" wx:if="{{item.createdAtLabel}}">🕐 创建于 {{item.createdAtLabel}}</text>
          <!-- 👪 家长绑定信息：有绑定才展示这一行 -->
          <text class="pa-tenant-row" wx:if="{{item.patriarch}}">👪 家长：{{item.patriarch}}</text>

          <!-- 🆕（2026-09-10 操作区收敛）此前最多同时铺开 3 个按钮，即便
               单行放得下也会把卡片撑得很高，门店一多滚动体验差。改为与
               上面机构卡片（.pa-tenant-actions）同一套模式：1 个高频主
               操作（停用/启用）保持一键直达 + 其余低频操作（解除家长/
               移出机构/加入机构）收进"⋯更多"原生 ActionSheet，
               见 onOpenStoreMoreActions -->
          <view class="pa-tenant-store-actions">
            <view
              class="pa-tenant-action-btn"
              hover-class="btn-hover"
              data-storeid="{{item._id}}"
              data-storename="{{item.storeName}}"
              data-status="{{item.status}}"
              bindtap="onSetStoreStatus"
            >{{item.status === 'inactive' ? '启用门店' : '停用门店'}}</view>
            <view class="pa-tenant-more-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" data-item="{{item}}" bindtap="onOpenStoreMoreActions">⋯</view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <!-- 🆕 移除底部整条操作栏后由这里补一份底部安全区留白，替代
             .pa-sheet-actions 原来兼职的 env(safe-area-inset-bottom) -->
        <view style="height: calc(16rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));"></view>
      </scroll-view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 🌸 底部抽屉：开通/续费 -->
  <view class="pa-sheet-mask" wx:if="{{showRenewSheet}}" bindtap="onCloseRenewForm">
    <view class="pa-sheet-box" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="pa-sheet-handle"></view>
      <text class="pa-sheet-title">为【{{renewForm.tenantName}}】开通/续费</text>

      <text class="pa-field-label">套餐档位</text>
      <view class="pa-plan-row">
        <view class="pa-plan-tag {{renewForm.planType === 'basic' ? 'active' : ''}}" hover-class="btn-hover" data-plan="basic" bindtap="onSelectPlan">基础版</view>
        <view class="pa-plan-tag {{renewForm.planType === 'pro' ? 'active' : ''}}" hover-class="btn-hover" data-plan="pro" bindtap="onSelectPlan">专业版</view>
        <view class="pa-plan-tag {{renewForm.planType === 'enterprise' ? 'active' : ''}}" hover-class="btn-hover" data-plan="enterprise" bindtap="onSelectPlan">旗舰版</view>
      </view>

      <text class="pa-field-label">服务开始日期</text>
      <input class="pa-input {{renewFormErrors.serviceStartDate ? 'pa-input-error' : ''}}" placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD" value="{{renewForm.serviceStartDate}}" bindinput="onRenewFormInput" data-field="serviceStartDate" />
      <text class="pa-field-error" wx:if="{{renewFormErrors.serviceStartDate}}">{{renewFormErrors.serviceStartDate}}</text>

      <!-- 🆓 基础版免费、无到期概念：日期选择换成一条置灰的"永久有效"提示，
           不再让平台管理员误以为要给免费版也挑一个到期日 -->
      <text class="pa-field-label">服务到期日期</text>
      <view class="pa-permanent-badge" wx:if="{{renewForm.planType === 'basic'}}">🌿 永久有效，无需续费</view>
      <block wx:else>
        <input class="pa-input {{renewFormErrors.serviceExpireDate ? 'pa-input-error' : ''}}" placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD" value="{{renewForm.serviceExpireDate}}" bindinput="onRenewFormInput" data-field="serviceExpireDate" />
        <text class="pa-field-error" wx:if="{{renewFormErrors.serviceExpireDate}}">{{renewFormErrors.serviceExpireDate}}</text>
      </block>

      <text class="pa-field-label">门店数量配额</text>
      <input class="pa-input {{renewForm.planType === 'basic' ? 'pa-input-disabled' : ''}}" type="number" placeholder="如：10" value="{{renewForm.storeLimit}}" disabled="{{renewForm.planType === 'basic'}}" bindinput="onRenewFormInput" data-field="storeLimit" />
      <text class="pa-field-hint" wx:if="{{renewForm.planType === 'basic'}}">基础版为免费版固定配额（2 家门店），不可调整</text>

      <text class="pa-field-label">开通/续费原因（必填，留痕审计）</text>
      <textarea class="pa-textarea {{renewFormErrors.reason ? 'pa-input-error' : ''}}" placeholder="{{renewForm.planType === 'basic' ? '如：新机构爱心互助接入 / 免费开通' : '如：新机构首次开通 / 年度续费'}}" value="{{renewForm.reason}}" bindinput="onRenewFormInput" data-field="reason" />
      <text class="pa-field-error" wx:if="{{renewFormErrors.reason}}">{{renewFormErrors.reason}}</text>

      <view class="pa-sheet-actions">
        <button class="pa-btn-cancel" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCloseRenewForm" disabled="{{renewSubmitting}}">取消</button>
        <button class="pa-btn-submit" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onSubmitRenew" loading="{{renewSubmitting}}" disabled="{{renewSubmitting}}">确认提交</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

</view>
